            "review_title": "Review at Guys Kafe'",
            "review_text": "Lars Svensson\nKiruna, Sweden2 contributions\n0\nCozy place. Great tasting Arabica Coffee\nApr 2021\nOne of the good places to taste Arabica coffee in Hanoi IMHO. This coffee shop is small, but you can sit and enjoy coffee on the sidewalk in Vietnamese traditional style.\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 13, 2021",
